WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,880
Don't worry, there won't be any danger

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,880
Just wait patiently

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,350
Sister-in-law, you were too domineering just now

4
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:13,150
I have never seen anyone dare to talk to her like this, your brother.

5
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:16,360
No, no, no, Tingting, you misunderstood

6
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,760
The reason why I said she was your sister-in-law earlier

7
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,360
Mainly to support you

8
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,360
Actually, your brother and I

9
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,360
I know I'm not married yet

10
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,480
I know, sister-in-law

11
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,010
I was angry just now

12
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:31,010
Smile, I'll take you to buy milk tea

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,300
A cup of milk tea just wants to coax me.

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,700
So what do you want?

15
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,900
I listen to you today

16
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:44,100
Hey Limao, who's here?

17
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,000
Do you think you can run away?

18
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:51,770
I advise you not to run away

19
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:58,820
Brother, please spare me

20
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:00,620
I'm really just a pony when it comes to hitting people.

21
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,020
It's all what the bald heads asked us to do.

22
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:05,230
And last night we also went to the destination and stayed all night.

23
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:09,460
I did everything you said, take a look

24
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,520
My injuries haven't healed yet.

25
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,520
Please, brother, please spare me.

26
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:15,320
Get up. I have something to ask you.

27
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:18,230
Let him wait aside first

28
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,420
Go ahead and wait for me for a while, baby

29
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:24,130
Brother, I really just follow orders and do things for me

30
00:01:24,850 --> 00:01:29,080
Don't be nervous. I just want to ask you a few words. Thank you, brother.

31
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:31,220
Baldhead is dead, right?

32
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:32,420
you you know
